      "text": "6. WHEN REPLACING SOLENOID"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "(a) For the No. 3 solenoid,"
    },
    {
      "type": "list",
      "ordered": false,
      "items": [
        "Install the solenoid into the bore.",
        "Tighten the two bolts."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "torque_spec",
      "component": "No. 3 solenoid bolts",
      "value": "55 kg-cm (48 in.-lb, 5.4 N·m)"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "(b) For the No. 1 and 2 solenoids,"
    },
    {
      "type": "list",
      "ordered": false,
      "items": [
        "Make sure that the two valve spring are installed correctly.",
        "Install the solenoid over the gasket and install the center of the bolt.",
        "Tighten the three bolts."
      ]
    },
